in @prism
in @meta
in @glass
in @song

# ============================================================
# §1 The five-operation prism at species altitude
# ============================================================

# === prism @song/voice — the species declaration ===
#
# The five-operation body carries `song_voice` (inherited from @song
# family-root at `shards/song.mirror` §2) as the species's
# operational surface. Species specialises `focus @ temporal` at
# temporal-experiential altitude per family-root #S3 (five-op
# temporal specialisation candidate):
#
#   focus @ temporal   = attend to ONE voice / one line at a time
#                        (soloing; solistic attention). THE
#                        PRINCIPAL SPECIES CONTRIBUTION TO #S3
#                        AT SPECIES ALTITUDE — this species IS the
#                        substrate name for what solistic attention
#                        produces when focus fires at temporal
#                        altitude.
#   project @ temporal = down-project the polyphony to a single
#                        voice line (the audible-altitude
#                        specialisation of the orchestra-altitude
#                        section-authority reading).
#   split @ temporal   = decompose the polyphony into its
#                        constituent voices (score preparation at
#                        the voice-line altitude).
#   shift @ temporal   = advance the voice to its next authored
#                        moment; delegates to @kintsugi/shift per
#                        #S2 witness (inherited from sibling
#                        @song/progression's `advance` action;
#                        `advance` on a voice IS a shift of the
#                        voice's harmonic-position witness).
#   settle @ temporal  = discharge the voice at its authored
#                        closure event; composes with the family-
#                        root's `song_settles` composed bilateral
#                        through this species's `voice_line_valid`
#                        sub-predicate.
prism @song/voice {
  focus song_voice
  project song_voice
  split song_voice
  shift song_voice
  settle song_voice
}

# ============================================================
# §2 The temporal-altitude advance action
# ============================================================

# === advance — the voice's temporal shift at species altitude ===
#
# Reads a voice at moment `t` and produces the voice at moment
# `t+dt` by delegating to `@kintsugi/shift` at temporal altitude
# (per #S2 witness inherited from sibling `@song/progression`). The
# voice's harmonic-position witness IS the shifted invariant; the
# temporal `dt` IS the altitude handle.
#
# Composition point: `@kintsugi/shift`'s `shift(w, s, t) -> ref`
# action. Here at species altitude for `song_voice`:
#
#   source-altitude = moment `t` of the voice's authored trajectory
#   target-altitude = moment `t+dt` of the voice's authored
#                     trajectory
#   witness         = the voice's harmonic-position (the substrate's
#                     identity-invariant of the voice's current
#                     authored state)
#
# The hardlink semantic per `@kintsugi/shift`'s
# `shift_preserves_content` bilateral holds at temporal altitude:
# the voice's witness OID byte-equals across the temporal crossing;
# the declared temporal shape (moment `t` vs moment `t+dt`) is what
# changes; the voice's authorial identity IS preserved.
#
# This action IS the species-altitude specialisation of family-root
# `shift @ temporal` for the voice carrier. Inherited from sibling
# `@song/progression`'s `advance` at the sibling species altitude;
# the species-altitude specialisation is voice-focused: the shifted
# witness is a single voice's harmonic-position, not the whole
# progression's aggregated position.
#
# The body stays obligation-blocked (`\`): the realisation delegates
# to `@kintsugi/shift`, encodes the temporal `dt` as the altitude
# handle, emits the shifted voice. The substrate declares the
# species-altitude specialisation; consumers dispatch through the
# species boundary.
advance(v: song_voice, dt: ref) -> song_voice { \ }

# ============================================================
# §3 The sub-predicate (the THIRD and FINAL for song_settles)
# ============================================================

# === voice_line_valid — the THIRD sub-predicate closes song_settles ===
#
# THE THIRD (AND FINAL) SUB-PREDICATE of the family-root's
# `song_settles` composed bilateral (14th #53 instance). The voice
# carries voice-leading discipline: stepwise motion as default,
# intentional leap as attributed exception, parallel fifths and
# parallel octaves forbidden. The Splinter-pole discharge names the
# substrate maintaining the counterpoint tradition's voice-leading
# discipline (per Palestrina + Fux + Bach prior art) across the
# voice's authored temporal trajectory.
#
# Composes with `@epistemologic/math/music/voice` (forward-promised
# audible-altitude species per `shards/epistemologic/math/music.mirror`
# §"Species under this family") at the audible altitude. The audible-
# altitude ancestor declares voice-leading constraints as types;
# this species lifts those types to the temporal-experiential
# altitude by binding them to a voice's authored trajectory over
# time.
#
# Splinter-pole (`pass`): the voice-leading discipline holds — every
# temporal step maintains stepwise motion or an attributed
# intentional leap; parallel fifths/octaves do not appear; the
# contrapuntal labor is VISIBLE, attributed as compositional work at
# the score altitude; the eigenboard shows who authored which move;
# `@mirror/spectral/voice`'s peer-as-agent binding names the
# authorial voice at every step.
#
# Narcissus-pole (`failure`): GLUE WORK (per spec §8.2
# psychohistorical failure-mode naming; direct substrate-decl of
# GLUE WORK as a psychohistorical failure mode in Alex's
# `systemic.engineering` corpus). The contrapuntal work invisibly
# holds the harmony together but is NOT attributed as compositional
# labor; the voice-leading discipline is violated by the
# systematic-invisibility-of-stepwise-motion pattern; the voices
# carry the polyphony but their authorship is erased; the score
# cannot name who did the work; the Pack cannot repair what it
# cannot see. GLUE WORK IS labor that keeps the system running but
# is not counted, named, or attributed.
#
# Graded (`partial(confidence)`): the voice-leading is present but
# authored at reduced confidence — e.g., a leap without full
# attribution, or stepwise motion with ambiguous authorial trace.
# The substrate carries partial voice-leading discipline; the
# composed discharge composes at graded floor through the family-
# root's `song_settles`.
#
# The body stays obligation-blocked (`\`): the realisation reads
# the voice's authored trajectory over time, composes with
# `@epistemologic/math/music/voice`'s audible-altitude voice-
# leading verdict at each temporal step, cross-references the
# `@mirror/spectral/voice` authorship attribution at the orchestra
# altitude, emits the three-state verdict at the substrate floor.
# The substrate declares the sub-predicate here; the arithmetic
# lands when the family-root's `song_settles` composes all three
# sub-predicates at close.
voice_line_valid(v: song_voice, p: perturbation)
  -> verdict { \ }

# ============================================================
# §4 The out clauses
# ============================================================

out @song/voice
out advance
out voice_line_valid
